DESCRIPTION:Experience the artistry of Jonathan Lucas Hauser\, an Austrian
  pianist and composer whose music brings together breathtaking melodies\, 
 deep emotion\, and powerful storytelling. Jonathan invites audiences into 
 a world of beauty\, reflection\, and hope. His personal experiences in Ukr
 aine have given his compositions an especially meaningful connection to th
 e people and stories behind the war. For one special evening in Atlanta\, 
 Jonathan will bring his original piano music to the stage in an intimate c
 oncert where every note tells a story. And this is more than a concert. It
 ’s an opportunity to make a difference. Presented by HelpingUkraine.US\,
  Piano of Peace will support children living in war-aff\nCategory: Music\n
 Original listing: https://www.artsatl.org/event/piano-of-peace-a-benefit-c
