BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:OpenLAB 2026 | The Golf Between Us – Talk by Wassim Alsindi — 
 Madrid
DTSTART;TZID="UTC+01:00":20261128T193000
DTEND;TZID="UTC+01:00":20261128T193000
DTSTAMP:20261120T072223Z
UID:7fb27cc9ba1465aa27555c51ecc5@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Multidisciplinary\,Madrid\,Spain
DESCRIPTION:As a result of software’s evolution from drab infrastructure
  into all-pervasive regime\, computation is well past the point of modelli
 ng reality\; it now actively re-engineers physical space to accord with it
 s desiderata. Alsindi calls this spatial and material externalisation of c
 omputational logic upon our built environments Golf Futurism. From desert 
 megacities to post-industrial urban regeneration projects\, complex ecosys
 tems and civic spaces are being stripped of their interiority and heteroge
 neity and flattened into hyper-manicured\, privatised enclaves. The render
 ing engine becomes the ultimate tool of spatial control\, dictating synthe
 tic smoothness that treats ecological and social rich\nCategory: Multidisc
 iplinary\nOriginal listing: https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/schedule/ope
 nlab-2026-golf-between-us-talk-wassim-alsindi
LOCATION:Nave Una\, Plaza de Legazpi\, 8\, Madrid\, 28045
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/schedule/openlab-2026-golf-between-u
 s-talk-wassim-alsindi
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-REGION:europe
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-SOURCE:matadero-madrid
END:VEVENT
