DESCRIPTION:The Public Diplomacy Council of America's December First Monda
 y Forum will honor Atlanta and Boston\, the recipients of the Council's sp
 ecial Sports Diplomacy Award. Prof. Jay Wang of the University of Southern
  California will keynote the event\, which will also include remarks by re
