  successful FIFA World Cup competition in the United States\, PDCA announc
 ed in July that it would present a special award to recognize the most we
 lcoming 2026 U.S. FIFA World Cup host city/cities or community/communities
  with a special one-time award. The award was conceived by PDCA's Awards C
 ommittee in recognition of the extraordinary effor\nCategory: Lectures & S
